### Movie Backend API: run with the IntelliJ HTTP client or the VS Code REST Client.
### Docker Compose default is port 8080; change baseUrl in http-client.env.json if you set API_PORT.

### List movies (page and size are optional)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/movies?page=1&size=20

### Search by title (case-insensitive, partial)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/movies/search?query=dark&page=1&size=20

### Movie details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/movies/{{movieId}}

### Edit a movie (admin). Sends an FCM push to topic movie-updates.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/movies/{{movieId}}
Authorization: Basic {{adminUsername}} {{adminPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Dark Knight (Edited)",
  "overview": "New synopsis",
  "vote_average": 9.1,
  "genres": ["Action", "Crime"]
}

### Edit without credentials -> 401
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/movies/{{movieId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "x" }

### Invalid rating -> 400
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/movies/{{movieId}}
Authorization: Basic {{adminUsername}} {{adminPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "vote_average": 11 }
